#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengenalan"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the previous lesson, we took a first look at quantum error correction, focusing specifically on the 9-qubit Shor code.\n"
"In this lesson, we'll introduce the *stabilizer formalism*, which is a mathematical framework through which a broad class of quantum error correcting codes, known as *stabilizer codes*, can be specified and analyzed.\n"
"This includes the 9-qubit Shor code along with many other examples, including codes that seem likely to be well-suited to real-world quantum devices.\n"
"Not every quantum error correcting code is a stabilizer code, but many are, including every example that we'll see in this course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam pelajaran sebelumnya, kita telah melihat sekilas pembetulan ralat kuantum buat pertama kalinya, dengan tumpuan khusus pada kod Shor 9-Qubit.\n"
"Dalam pelajaran ini, kita akan memperkenalkan *formalisme penstabil*, iaitu rangka kerja matematik melaluinya kelas luas kod pembetulan ralat kuantum, yang dikenali sebagai *kod penstabil*, boleh ditentukan dan dianalisis.\n"
"Ini termasuk kod Shor 9-Qubit bersama banyak contoh lain, termasuk kod yang nampaknya sangat sesuai untuk peranti kuantum dunia sebenar.\n"
"Tidak semua kod pembetulan ralat kuantum adalah kod penstabil, tetapi banyak yang merupakan kod penstabil, termasuk setiap contoh yang akan kita lihat dalam kursus ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The lesson begins with a short discussion of Pauli matrices, and tensor products of Pauli matrices more generally, which can represent not only operations on qubits, but also measurements of qubits — in which case they're typically referred to as *observables*.\n"
"We'll then go back and take a second look at the repetition code and see how it can be described in terms of Pauli matrix observables.\n"
"This will both inform and lead into a general discussion of stabilizer codes, including several examples, basic properties of stabilizer codes, and how the fundamental tasks of encoding, detecting errors, and correcting those errors can be performed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelajaran ini bermula dengan perbincangan ringkas tentang matriks Pauli, dan hasil darab tensor matriks Pauli secara amnya, yang boleh mewakili bukan sahaja operasi pada Qubit, tetapi juga pengukuran Qubit — yang dalam kes itu biasanya dirujuk sebagai *boleh cerapan*.\n"
"Kita kemudian akan kembali dan melihat sekali lagi kod pengulangan serta bagaimana ia boleh diterangkan dari segi boleh cerapan matriks Pauli.\n"
"Ini akan memaklumkan dan membawa kepada perbincangan umum tentang kod penstabil, termasuk beberapa contoh, sifat asas kod penstabil, dan bagaimana tugas-tugas asas pengkodean, pengesanan ralat, dan pembetulan ralat tersebut boleh dilakukan.\n"

